Poco X3 Pro (vayu): the bootstrap console's splash framebuffer.

vayu's ABL leaves its DSC video-mode panel (CSOT, 1080x2400, 4320-byte rows)
scanning out cont_splash_region @ 0x9c000000 (live FDT and the shim probe of
2026-11-23: SSPP VIG0 src 0x9c000000 stride 0x10e0). Same 32MB block as RMX1931.

diff --git a/pexpert/pexpert/arm64/SWEET.h b/pexpert/pexpert/arm64/SWEET.h
--- a/pexpert/pexpert/arm64/SWEET.h
+++ b/pexpert/pexpert/arm64/SWEET.h
@@ -52,12 +52,12 @@
 #define SWEET_IPI_SGI             1       // SGI used for cross-CPU signals
 
 /*
- * Realme X2 Pro (RMX1931 / samurai): splash framebuffer ABL scans out
- * (cont_splash_region @ 0x9d000000, Samsung SOFEF03F-M 1080x2400 cmd-mode
+ * Poco X3 Pro (vayu): splash framebuffer ABL scans out
+ * (cont_splash_region @ 0x9c000000, CSOT 1080x2400 DSC video-mode
  * panel, 4320-byte rows). SWEET_EARLY_FB_BLOCK_PA is the 32MB L2 block
  * [0x9c000000, 0x9e000000) mapped Device-GRE holding it.
  */
-#define SWEET_EARLY_FB_PA         0x9d000000
+#define SWEET_EARLY_FB_PA         0x9c000000
 #define SWEET_EARLY_FB_BLOCK_PA   0x9c000000
 #define SWEET_EARLY_FB_WIDTH      1080
 #define SWEET_EARLY_FB_HEIGHT     2400
